    "abstract": "MMFFNet proposes an encoder-fusion-decoder multimodal feature fusion network for RGB-T crowd counting. It uses a feature fusion module to fuse multi-level RGB and thermal features and a feature decoding module based on attention mechanisms to improve density map estimation while balancing accuracy and computational cost."
